Description: Basic functions that leverage the tidyverse for analyses of
    (pseudo)bulk omic data. Differential expression and gene set enrichment
    are run with augere.de and augere.gsea, and basicBulk normalizes a
    SummarizedExperiment and tidies their results. It provides tables and
    publication-ready plots for the full workflow: PCA and expression QC,
    volcano, MA, and heatmap displays of differential expression, overlap
    (UpSet) and logFC correlation summaries across contrasts, and GSEA
    (Reactome) pathway analysis.
